<item>
            <title>[LU-8933] sanity test_51d: object distribution between OSTs not even</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-8933</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for Nathaniel Clark &amp;lt;nathaniel.l.clark@intel.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href=&quot;https://testing.hpdd.intel.com/test_sets/15455bfe-be59-11e6-aac0-5254006e85c2&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://testing.hpdd.intel.com/test_sets/15455bfe-be59-11e6-aac0-5254006e85c2&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The sub-test test_51d failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;OST 2 has less objects vs OST 1  (228 &amp;lt; 278
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;


&lt;p&gt;This test passed on previous versions of this patch:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://testing.hpdd.intel.com/sub_tests/063ca5b6-bcf8-11e6-89a8-5254006e85c2&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://testing.hpdd.intel.com/sub_tests/063ca5b6-bcf8-11e6-89a8-5254006e85c2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://testing.hpdd.intel.com/sub_tests/a549fcae-b8ba-11e6-80de-5254006e85c2&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://testing.hpdd.intel.com/sub_tests/a549fcae-b8ba-11e6-80de-5254006e85c2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Please provide additional information about the failure here.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Info required for matching: sanity 51d&lt;/p&gt;</description>
